{'symbol': 'AEP', 'date': '2022-09-30 08:30:00', 'title': 'ALGONQUIN AGREES TO PATH FORWARD ON KENTUCKY POWER ACQUISITION', 'text': 'OAKVILLE, ON , SEPT. 30, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ - ON SEPTEMBER 29, 2022, LIBERTY UTILITIES CO. ("LIBERTY"), THE INDIRECT SUBSIDIARY OF ALGONQUIN POWER & UTILITIES CORP. ("AQN" OR THE "COMPANY") (TSX: AQN) (NYSE: AQN), AND AMERICAN ELECTRIC POWER (NASDAQ: AEP) ("AEP") ENTERED INTO AN AMENDMENT (THE "AMENDMENT") TO THE STOCK PURCHASE AGREEMENT\xa0DATED OCTOBER 26, 2021 PURSUANT TO WHICH LIBERTY AGREED TO PURCHASE KENTUCKY POWER COMPANY AND AEP KENTUCKY TRANSMISSION COMPANY, INC. (THE "TRANSACTION").'}